      "mode": 0,
      "title": "zen-image-edit: install & usage",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## zen-image-edit \u2014 Qwen-Image-2.1 on Qwen3.5-0.8B\n\nText-to-image **and** editing with the 0.8B encoder plus the adapter, instead of the native 17.5 GB\nQwen3-VL-8B. The DiT, VAE and sampler are stock ComfyUI.\n\n### What to download\n\n| file | where it goes | link |\n|---|---|---|\n| `adapter_v12.safetensors` (0.64 GB) | `ComfyUI/models/` | https://github.com/recoilme/zen-image-edit-comfyui/releases/download/v2/adapter_v12.safetensors |\n| `qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors` (14.2 GB) | `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` | https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 |\n| `qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors` (0.7 GB) | `ComfyUI/models/vae/` | https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 |\n\n```bash\ncd ComfyUI\ncurl -L -o models/adapter_v12.safetensors \\\n  https://github.com/recoilme/zen-image-edit-comfyui/releases/download/v2/adapter_v12.safetensors\n```\n\nThe encoder itself (`Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B`, 1.7 GB) is fetched by the loader on first run.\nNeeds ComfyUI with Qwen-Image-2.1 support (`comfy/ldm/qwen_image21/model.py`) and `transformers >= 5.17`.\n\n### Text to image\n\nLeave `image_1 \u2026` empty (they are optional) and run. `cfg = 1`, `euler`, 25\u201340 steps.\n\n### Editing\n\nUn-mute the two `LoadImage` nodes (Ctrl+M), point them at your files, then:\n\n* `image_1` \u2014 the **edit target**: the canvas comes from it and its pose, background and clothing are\n  what stays;\n* `image_2 \u2026` \u2014 the references whose identity you copy;\n* mention them in the prompt as `<image1>`, `<image2>` \u2014 words like \"the first image\" do not work.\n\n**Mind the order.** Here the target is `image_1`, same as in the stock `TextEncodeQwenImage21`. The\ndiffusers pipeline of this model is the other way round \u2014 there the target is the *last* image. Copy a\nprompt from one to the other without swapping the picture order and you get a hybrid instead of a swap:\nthe source image becomes the canvas, so the model only mixes the face in. Symptom: \"it does not replace\nanything\".\n\nThe VAE must be connected to the text-encode node: the DiT splices reference images in as latents.\n\n### Scheduler\n\n`ModelSamplingAuraFlow` is set to **shift 5.0** \u2014 that is the schedule the diffusers build of this\nmodel ships (ComfyUI's own default for 2.1 is 0.69). Lower it back to 1.0\u20131.7 if you want to compare.\n\n### Limits\n\nEnglish prompts only; numerals on signage can come out wrong (\"OPEN 24 HOURS\" \u2192 \"OPEN 26 HOURS\").\n"
      ],
